# palOS installs software through the palOS Store (Ubuntu's archive and the Snap Store), without
# Ubuntu's own upgrade, subscription or crash-report tools (the Store does apps, updates and drivers).
# Written by palos-branding; packages already on this computer when palOS was set up aren't listed.

